{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Depart:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear up and leave on a\u00a0Roguelike RPG expedition to the unknown, strategize your way to victory against impossible odds in turn-based combat. It's time for the tyrannical rule of the GOBLIN KING to end!\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806630/extras/296b44ff8da027adc95fb97a15f0636f.avif?t=1766337679\" width=600 height=328 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DEFEAT THE GOBLIN KING is a solo dev endeavour in trying to create a fast paced, challenging and engaging turn based game where you build and empower your character as you go.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806630/extras/9bb1c4e7c94e3408bb270263e8a71174.avif?t=1766337679\" width=200 height=200 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806630/extras/b63cef86755601f43164aad894f19275.avif?t=1766337679\" width=200 height=200 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806630/extras/a6aac40b7800787ca68d0fc246d4b2fc.avif?t=1766337679\" width=200 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A journey with:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>9 characters, each with a unique moveset and stats</strong>\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 different zones with distinct visuals and challenges</strong>\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"b